   "notes": "Volumetric BM3 fit to all 23+/-3 degC SrO data through 34.05 GPa. K0=91.3+/-2.7 GPa and K0'=4.3+/-0.3 are one-standard-deviation fit errors. The fixed V0 error represents the paper's stated 0.3% volume accuracy. Between about 7 and 30.7 GPa the nominal B1 cell shows a small tetragonal distortion, but the paper reports no volume discontinuity and deliberately fits all data together. No parameter covariance is published.",
